    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 26 Castlemanor; a 2 bedroom mid terrace bungalow situated within Castlemanor Retirement Village.Designed specifically as a retirement village together with a 71-bed nursing home the development caters for the needs of the elderly at all stages. The units facilitate independent living within a secure development. Extending to 60 sq. m (646sq. ft) approx., light-filled and relaxing accommodation comprises; entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen / dining room, 2 bedrooms, ensuite and a bathroom. Communal gardens with well-manicured bedding and shrubbery border the property with parking bays adjacent.Conveniently located 1.5 km approx. from the heart of Cavan town the property is accessible to all amenities and services by foot, car or local transport links. Viewing is recommended by the sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.20m x 5.50m\nLaminate flooring, coving.\n\nSitting Room - 4.23m x 3.11m\nLaminate flooring, electric insert with marble surround, coving, centrepiece.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.84m x 3.05m\nTiled flooring, shaker style fitted kitchen, door to rear, coving.\n\nShower Room - 2.17m x 1.98m\nFully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, electric shower.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.14m x 2.12m\nLaminate flooring, fitted wardrobes.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.47m x 3.14m\nLaminate flooring, fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 2.22m x 1.01m\nFully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, electric shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Purpose built retirement village.</li><li>Well maintained communal areas. </li><li>Laminate and tiled flooring throughout.</li><li>Convenient location.</li><li>Local link bus stop at the entry.</li><li>Mains Services. </li><li>Gas Heating.</ul>"
      },
